 r←Test_SelectionTool_007(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;v;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "SelectionTool. Create" with "minsize" and "size" (greater!) specified.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←0
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.addToCaption←'"minSize" test'
 parms.colTitles←⊂'Running numbers'
 parms.default←¯10↑6↑1
 parms.hasVersionField←0
 parms.info←'Tries to make the form smaller than "minSize"'
 parms.minSize←500 700
 parms.posn←60 70
 parms.size←520 720
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.SelectionTool.Create⍕¨1+⍳10
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp n.∆Form.Size≢parms.size
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Configure',n.∆Form.Posn,100 150  ⍝ Make it much smaller
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp n.∆Form.Size≢parms.minSize
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
